==Question #7==
{{Cquote2|Can we please poll a buff to Thammarons sceptre, the laughing stock of the Wildy weapons? It's been suggested 20+ times with significant upvotes but never addressed by the team.}}

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bpVigcSCZ0w&t=1658 Youtube Time Stamp]

* '''Mod Bruno:''' I'm going to say we've probably addressed it 20+ times. I, for sure, have addressed it at least a handful of times in my time at Jagex!
* '''Mod Bruno:''' We know the Thammaron's Sceptre isn't the best weapon, especially compared to the other Wilderness weapons. The thing is how do we go about buffing it? We have to make sure that it doesn't make other weapons useless, and still have a good use in the Wilderness, which is a little bit of a hard thing to balance. Also, we're not overly happy about people merching them like they might be trying to do so here. The players themselves are also not huge fans of that! That's my take on it.
